CREATED:20260416T173519Z
DESCRIPTION:The Congregation's weekly Adult Forum offers a variety of gues
 t speakers\, presentations and discussions on a wide range of thought-pro
 voking topics\, including Biblical studies\, current social issues and th
 e work of mission agencies.  \n\nThis week's guest speaker is John H. Arm
 strong\, Author\, Mentor and Minister.  John has taught with us several t
 imes in the past.  In his latest book\, The Transforming Fire of Divine L
 ove: My Long\, Slow Journey into the Love of God\, John shares his deeply
  personal story of his long\, slow journey to know and experience God as 
 a compassionate and loving Father. As a pastor trained in evangelical the
 ology he came to know and experience the teaching of the whole church abo
 ut God\, thus the story he tells will inform how you can know the God who
  is amazing love.\n\nAdult Forum aims to deepen the faith and understandi
 ng of adults through shared learning experiences. Classes include program
 s and discussions on contemporary issues in light of Christian teachings.
 
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20260904T143936Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260906T094500
LAST-MODIFIED:20260904T143936Z
