DESCRIPTION:Whether you're experienced in research or just getting started
 \, strong mentor relationships are powerful tools for advancing your acad
 emic and professional goals. This workshop will focus on how to identify 
 and strengthen your relationship with your mentor so you can get the most
  out of your research experience. Learn how students can connect with PIs
 \, bench mentors\, thesis advisors\, and more in this interactive worksho
 p.
