DESCRIPTION:Find a spiritual home with one of Duke's two-dozen Religious L
 ife groups\, representing faiths including Buddhist\, Christian\, Hindu\,
  Jewish\, and Muslim.\n\n*** This fair takes places on the Bryan Center P
 laza. ***\n\nMeet the leaders of these groups during this Religious Life 
 fair. Talk with campus chaplains to learn when their groups meet for pray
 er\, study\, and fun.\n\nSee the list of Duke's Religious Life groups and
  how to contact them: https://chapel.duke.edu/religiouslife .
