CREATED:20260824T172122Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us to discuss a work-in-progress from a faculty member or
  visiting scholar.  Writing is a largely solitary task.  Colloquia are ex
 tremely helpful\, providing valuable audience and peer feedback to author
 s often struggling to strike the right balance of scholarship and accessi
 bility.\n\nPapers under discussion will be distributed prior to (and excl
 usively for the purpose of) this event and\, as they are "in progress\," 
 should never be considered quotable or shareable.\n\nPlease RSVP to craig
 .kolman@gmail.com to receive your paper\, once available.\n\nLunch will b
 e provided at 11:45am in Gavins Commons\, Rm 224.  The colloquium will be
 gin promptly at 12pm.
DURATION:PT1H30M
