DESCRIPTION:Are you currently enrolled in or considering enrollment in the
  undergraduate Energy and the Environment Certificate program? Join your 
 peers at the Welcome Back Lunch! We'll start off the semester strong with
  some community-building and free food. Students will have the chance to 
 get better acquainted with each other and meet the faculty co-directors o
 f the certificate program-Becky Simmons (Pratt School of Engineering)\, L
 uana Lima (Nicholas School of the Environment)\, and Tom Cinq-Mars (Nicho
 las Institute). Come out and learn how the certificate fits into the wide
  array of curricular programs at Duke. Lunch will be provided.\n\n*This e
 vent is open to Trinity and Pratt undergraduates who are either already e
 nrolled in or considering enrollment in the Certificate program.*\n\nRSVP
 : <a href="https://duke.is/eecwelcome">duke.is/eecwelcome</a>
DURATION:PT1H
